    {
      "claim_type": "module_role",
      "scope": {
        "type": "module",
        "module": "flash_state"
      },
      "summary": "该模块是SPI主控的结构化状态机封装层，负责管理面向SPI Flash的读写传输状态与使能时序。",
      "subject": "flash_state",
      "explanation": "模块内部实例化spi_master_spi0，通过状态机（r_state）控制SPI启动条件（assign 0表达的w_spi_en逻辑）并利用片选信号产生完成指示（assign 2表达的o_finish）。连接的i_ctl与i_data2spi提供命令与写数据，读取数据由o_dataFspi输出，体现了Flash协议端的封装。",
      "signals": [
        "w_spi_en",
        "o_finish",
        "r_state",
        "i_startRead",
        "r_start_spi",
        "i_ctl",
        "i_data2spi",
        "o_dataFspi",
        "i_readflag",
        "w_spi_cs_n",
        "o_RXNE",
        "o_TXE"
      ],
      "instances": [
        "u_spi_master"
      ],
      "doc_priority": "primary",
      "requires_rtl_source_review": false,
      "confidence": "high",
      "evidence": [
        {
